        "description": {
            "value": "<p><em>Aquarius &mdash; 2nd Technique, gained at level 6.</em></p><p><em>Ice Rings &mdash; rings of cold generated from the fingers, which surround the target and render the captive unable to move.</em></p><p>The target must attempt a Reflex save.</p><p><strong>Success</strong> Half damage and slowed 1 for 1 round.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> @Damage[3d8[cold]] damage and <strong>immobilized</strong> for 1 minute (Escape DC equal to your Cosmo DC; the rings have Hardness 8 and 30 Hit Points, and shatter if destroyed).</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, and it is also <strong>restrained</strong>.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightening (+2 levels)</strong> The damage increases by 1d8, and the rings gain +2 Hardness and +10 Hit Points.</p><p>On a day your constellation is <strong>Ascendant</strong> this Technique heightens as though you were 4 levels higher; on a <strong>Zenith</strong>, 8 levels higher.</p>"
